wf-lattice-enter-moored = Back in anchored space. The Lattice holds here.
wf-lattice-enter-slack = Leaving anchored space. Restricted space: {$band}. Unsafe. Trust your instruments less.
wf-lattice-enter-adrift = Restricted space: {$band}. Unsafe. The Lattice barely holds here.
wf-lattice-enter-untethered = Restricted space: {$band}. The Lattice does not reach here. FTL drives are dead. Turn back.
wf-lattice-enter-deep = {$band}. Nothing holds here.

wf-lattice-ftl-dead = The FTL drive won't spool. Nothing out here holds still enough to jump from.
wf-lattice-ftl-target-dead = The FTL drive won't lock on. Nothing out there holds still enough to jump to.

ent-WFLatticeAnchorMarker = reality anchor
    .desc = Holds the Lattice field.
ent-WFLatticeAnchorRelayMarker = relay anchor
    .desc = Holds a little of the Lattice field.

wf-lattice-phantom-contact = Unknown contact

wf-lattice-radio-wrap = [color={$color}]\[Common\] [bold]{$name}[/bold] says, "{$message}"[/color]
wf-lattice-radio-name = Unknown

wf-lattice-whisper-1 = The hull creaks in a rhythm. It sounds like counting.
wf-lattice-whisper-2 = Your hands feel slightly too far away.
wf-lattice-whisper-3 = You were just somewhere else. You can't remember where.
wf-lattice-whisper-4 = Someone is standing behind you. Nobody is there.
wf-lattice-whisper-5 = The stars outside are in the wrong places.
wf-lattice-whisper-6 = You hear your own voice from the next room.
wf-lattice-whisper-7 = The deck tilts. The instruments say it didn't.
wf-lattice-whisper-8 = Something is pulling at you from the direction of the black hole.
wf-lattice-whisper-9 = You count the crew. You get one too many.
wf-lattice-whisper-10 = The lights are a colour that doesn't have a name.
wf-lattice-whisper-11 = The air tastes of metal and old blood.
wf-lattice-whisper-12 = For a moment you forget which way is out.

wf-lattice-radio-1 = ...can anyone hear me... the anchor's gone dark...
wf-lattice-radio-2 = ...we're still out here... we never left...
wf-lattice-radio-3 = ...turn around. Turn around. Turn around...
wf-lattice-radio-4 = ...it's so quiet out here... why is it so quiet...
wf-lattice-radio-5 = ...this is the relief crew, we're coming to get you...
wf-lattice-radio-6 = ...don't trust the scanner. It's lying...
wf-lattice-radio-7 = ...the Lattice is holding. The Lattice is holding. The Lattice is...
wf-lattice-radio-8 = ...I can see your ship from here...

