    .desc = A shard of something that shouldn't hold together. It does anyway, and it's worth a fortune.
    .suffix = 1
ent-WFLatticeStabiliser = Drift stabiliser
    .desc = Holds a little anchored space round the ship it's bolted to. Needs a lot of power.
ent-WFFlatpackLatticeStabiliser = Drift stabiliser flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for building a Drift stabiliser.
ent-WFLatticeCharm = anchor charm
    .desc = A shard of exotic matter on a chain. Worn round the neck, it keeps your head clearer out past the Lattice.

ent-WFLatticeAnchorCoreAlpha = reality anchor
    .desc = One of the Lattice's original anchors. Its glyphs hum in a key you feel in your teeth, and it holds the sector together.
ent-WFLatticeAnchorCoreBeta = reality anchor
    .desc = One of the Lattice's original anchors. Its glyphs hum in a key you feel in your teeth, and it holds the sector together.
